# Pairs with NonEnrolledDropped. The enrollment gate lives in the gRPC push
# handler, so a run replayed from the causal buffer or the dead-letter queue
# reaches the tree ungated.
MODULE: ReceiverGateInPushHandlerOnly
TARGET: NonEnrolledDropped
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: only the push path is gated; a replayed run is applied unconditionally
PERTURBS: ApplyRun

--- FIND
        result == IF mode = NotEnrolled THEN "dropped"
--- REPLACE
        result == IF p = "replay" THEN "applied" ELSE IF mode = NotEnrolled THEN "dropped"
--- END